          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-09-16 · canvas · shared rows above one journey band; brief rewritten into its fixed sections, history moved here\n2026-09-16 · kit 1.0.0 · bell badge → the code's dot (count-badge gap declined), BottomNav lights its tab per screen, HeaderBar hides the placeholder action\n2026-09-16 · D78 · rule cards, feed, cómo te aviso (+ push switch), sheet sizes and labels, bandeja copy, icons and times mirrored to the code; Vacío rebuilt as the index with no rules\n2026-09-16 · removed 'Sincronización de precios reanudada' — the code never sends a recovery notice\n2026-09-16 · D119 · notices carry the reader's facts; the bandeja groups by day\n2026-09-16 · new artboards: Nueva regla · Calendario, Bandeja · Vacía\n2026-09-05 · #586 · the brief's 'the build is a board item' line corrected — D84 retires the engine, it is not pending\n2026-09-05 · D80 · the Confluencia artboard is deleted — the semáforo is a block in the asset detail, not a screen of its own\n2026-09-05 · D80 · brief keeps the reasoning the artboard carried: what nothing computes, and that D3 moved the gate from no-definition to no-engine\n2026-08-29 · Bandeja gains the bulk-alta notification; Todas 12 → 13. Its body names the next step, which the shipped copy does not — CODE_CHANGES\n2026-08-29 · 🐞 fixed: the price-sync row credited Alpha Vantage, which is registered for fundamentals only and has never served a price. Now DataBursatil\n2026-08-29 · this frame created; the brief was not audited for dated lines in this pass\n2026-08-27 · kit 0.8.1 · third channel toggle dropped against the schema's two booleans; SwitchRow and a local HeaderBar vendored; bell badge unclipped",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
